OL,3,GNEWSAResidents demand action over
OL,4,A'Plymouth pongs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near two of a city's
OL,7,Fsewage treatment works are calling for
OL,8,Faction over smells they say fill their
OL,9,Fhomes and prevent them from using their
OL,10,Fgardens.
OL,12,FPeople in Plympton and Cattedown are
OL,13,Famong those who said the "eggy"
OL,14,Fsewage-like pongs, which residents said
OL,15,Fplagued parts of Plymouth for years.
OL,17,FLocals living near South West Water's
OL,18,FMarsh Mills wastewater treatment works
OL,19,Fclaim the smells have become worse
OL,20,Fsince the development of a nearby new
OL,21,Ftown, Sherford, which also uses the
OL,22,Ffacility.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
