OL,3,GNEWSAResidents demand action over
OL,4,A'Plymouth pongs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water has set up an online
OL,7,Ftool for residents to report the odours
OL,8,Fand said it takes the matter
OL,9,F"seriously".
